<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="git-addon-git-branch-manager">
  <title>Git Branch Manager View</title>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>Git Branch Manager</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>branches</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body>
    <p id="p_elv_4qy_kpb">The <uicontrol>Git Branch Manager</uicontrol> view shows the local and
      remote branches for the current repository.</p>
    <section id="section_git_branch_manager_how_to_open">
      <title>Open Git Branch Manager</title>
      <p>To open the <uicontrol>Git Branch Manager</uicontrol> view, use one of the following:</p>
      <ul id="ul_git_branch_manager_view_access">
        <li id="li_git_branch_manager_view_access_staging">Select <uicontrol><image
              href="../img/Branch18.png" id="image_branch_icon"/>Show Git Branch Manager
            view</uicontrol> from the <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol> toolbar.</li>
        <li id="li_git_branch_manager_view_access_window">Go to <menucascade>
            <uicontrol>Window</uicontrol>
            <uicontrol>Show View</uicontrol>
            <uicontrol>Git Branch Manager</uicontrol>
          </menucascade>.</li>
        <li>Select <xref
            href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_show_branches"
              ><uicontrol>Show Branches</uicontrol></xref> from the <xref
            href="git-addon-git-menu.dita#git-addon-git-menu"><uicontrol>Git</uicontrol>
          menu</xref>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <p>
      <fig id="fig_git_branch_manager_view">
        <title>Git Branch Manager view</title>
        <image href="../img/git-addon/branches/branch_manager_view.png" id="image_qzw_5sk_gjc"
          placement="inline"/>
      </fig>
    </p>
    <section id="section_git_branch_manager_filter">
      <title>Text Filter and Refresh</title>
      <p>Use <uicontrol>Text filter</uicontrol> to narrow the branch tree by name. Select
          <uicontrol><image href="../img/Refresh16.png" placement="inline"
            id="image_fm3_25k_gjc"/>Refresh</uicontrol> to reload branch information. Opening the
        view or selecting <uicontrol>Refresh</uicontrol> also fetches updates in the background so
        remote branches and tracking information stay current.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_git_branch_manager_branch_tree">
      <title>Branch Tree</title>
      <p id="p_flv_4qy_kpb">The branch tree groups branches into <uicontrol>Local</uicontrol> and
          <uicontrol>Remote</uicontrol> nodes. Hover over a branch name to see a tooltip with
        information about the last commit, including author and date.</p>
      <p id="p_git_branch_manager_remote_branch_intro">For remote branches, use <xref
          href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_checkout"
            ><uicontrol>Checkout</uicontrol></xref> to create a local branch from the selected
        remote branch.</p>
      <p id="p_git_branch_manager_fetch_actions">Right-click <uicontrol>Remote</uicontrol> to fetch
        all configured remotes, or right-click an individual remote such as
          <uicontrol>origin</uicontrol> to fetch only that remote.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_git_branch_manager_local_branch_actions">
      <title>Local Branch Actions</title>
      <p id="p_glv_4qy_kpb">Right-click a local branch to open its context menu.</p>
      <p>
        <fig id="fig_git_branch_manager_branch_context_menu">
          <title>Git Branch Manager local branch context menu</title>
          <image href="../img/git-addon/branches/branch_context_menu.png" placement="inline"
            id="image_git_branch_manager_branch_context_menu"/>
        </fig>
      </p>
      <p>For a full list of actions, see <xref
          href="git-addon-actions-git-branch-manager.dita#git-addon-actions-git-branch-manager/section_git_branch_manager_local_branch_actions"
        />. Shared actions such as <xref
          href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_checkout"
            ><uicontrol>Checkout</uicontrol></xref>, <xref
          href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_create_branch"
            ><uicontrol>Create Branch</uicontrol></xref>, <xref
          href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_merge_branch_or_commit"
            ><uicontrol>Merge</uicontrol></xref>, and <xref
          href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_track_remote_branch"
            ><uicontrol>Track Remote Branch</uicontrol></xref> are described in <xref
          href="git-addon-actions-shared.dita#git-addon-actions-shared/section_shared_branch_actions"
        />.</p>
    </section>
  </body>
</topic>
